== C10 minimality countermodels (each satisfies the stated clauses and is NOT N-CLASS)
PASS C10.inv  [identity] G(2I, 2J') is the inverse of G(I/2, J'/2) (C2.inverse with a = I/2, b = J'/2: -(J'/2)^-1 = 2J')
